      "uid": "zhcn:a9ebbbc8cfeeef5951f54520",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "迷人景致――这位注定拥有璀璨未来的赛马娘\n……她既是我的担当赛马娘――也是青梅竹马。",
      "source_fingerprint": "91ecb0078ef5bdeb4d19189df6703d2d8561b59e6c68e68314df042f87e54517",
