      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "与她的邂逅发生在很久以前的童年时期。\n当搬到她家隔壁的时候、\n她们全家都温柔地接纳了我的到来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2d2d9a43c9523ea60c88963ea2ab5430f973ba920025aa589e1a2992bf353cd6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
