    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fec88a37ba8170953d646f05",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "诶嘿嘿……嗯。\n呐、来一起玩吧、姐姐！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6878ebcde352933293f9a4cde29028d61bab2ea9fe03331ea1bc0fdfb5a9977e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1114/storytimeline_501114100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        43,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/43/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:96d954c03944bf52df17379b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她总像个小妹妹似的、蹦蹦跳跳地跟在我身后。\n而这份认知的彻底改变、\n是在我首次目睹她全力奔跑的身影时――",
      "source_fingerprint": "d4c5f8f05f69ae166ab3923654129cbfea78752cf98b51211582036ee1b47fff",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1114/storytimeline_501114100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        44,
