    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1f0aa5c06fbc7d801ecbd10e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "参加闪耀系列赛的出道日终于确定了。\n接下来正要去递交必要的文件材料。",
      "source_fingerprint": "68a86e9d8e4f583bb5fbfd7d15d82ca24d12ade16f38884f18e212c1046e1151",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1114/storytimeline_501114100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        54,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/54/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f2b13f940d75da7f3f750ca7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "因为这是重要的第一步、我想要万无一失",
      "source_fingerprint": "7b533efe1b06dca136c62da2e57016f9a7de740496e81cfb6f803e9b8b882857",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
